' [TRACEABILITY HEADER]
' Project: HEAVENSTAY WELLNESS RESORT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (HSWRMS)
' Module: Module 4 — Dietary F&B Management (CORE) — BF-04
' Requirements Reference: SRS Ver2 (Section 2.4 - BF-04) & Project Specification Ver2 (Section 4, Module 4)
' Business Rules: BR-FNB-01 (Batch Availability), BR-FNB-02 (Allergy Filter), BR-FNB-03 (Data Minimization RBAC), BR-FNB-04 (Extra F&B Folio Posting)
' Legal Compliance: Nghị định 13/2023/NĐ-CP & 356/2025/NĐ-CP (Personal Data Protection PII)
' BF-04 Trigger: A Customer wants to select or order a meal during the retreat.
' BF-04 End Condition: The meal has been prepared/fulfilled and any additional F&B charge has been recorded in the Customer Folio.
' File: HSWRMS_BF04_MainFlow_Module4.puml

@startuml HSWRMS_BF04_MainFlow_Module4

title HEAVENSTAY WELLNESS RESORT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (HSWRMS)\nBF-04: PERSONALIZED DINING & F&B SERVICE FULFILLMENT\nMODULE 4 — DIETARY F&B MANAGEMENT (MAIN BUSINESS FLOW)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam fontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing true

' Actor & Participant Styling
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #F0F9FF
    BorderColor #0284C7
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #F0F9FF
    BorderColor #0284C7
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF7ED
    BorderColor #F97316
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 10
}

' Participants
actor "Customer\n(Khách hàng)" as Customer
actor "Chef / F&B Staff\n(Đầu bếp / Nhân viên F&B)" as Chef

participant "Guest App / Portal UI\n(Giao diện khách hàng)" as UI
participant "F&B Controller\n(Module 4 Backend)" as BE
participant "Module 1: Health Profile\n(RBAC Data Store)" as HealthDB
participant "Central Database\n(MEAL_ORDER & INVENTORY)" as DB
participant "Module 5: Guest Folio\n(Billing & Folio System)" as Folio

== Phase A: F&B Staff Manages Ingredient Batches & Menu Availability (UC16) ==

note over Chef, DB
  **UC16: Manage Ingredient Batches & Availability**
  BR-FNB-01: RemainingQuantity + ExpiryDate + ConditionStatus → MENU_ITEM.IsAvailable
end note

Chef -> UI : Open Ingredient Inventory Screen\n(F&B Dashboard)
UI -> BE : Request: Load INGREDIENT_BATCH list
BE -> DB : SELECT INGREDIENT, INGREDIENT_BATCH\n(RemainingQuantity, ExpiryDate, ConditionStatus)
DB --> BE : Return batch records
BE --> UI : Display batch inventory with condition status

alt New batch received
    Chef -> UI : Input Batch details\n(BatchNumber, ReceivedDate, ExpiryDate, Qty, ConditionStatus)
    UI -> BE : POST: Create INGREDIENT_BATCH
    BE -> DB : INSERT INGREDIENT_BATCH
else Discard expired batch
    Chef -> UI : Mark INGREDIENT_BATCH ConditionStatus = EXPIRED / DISCARDED
    UI -> BE : PATCH: Update ConditionStatus
    BE -> DB : UPDATE INGREDIENT_BATCH SET ConditionStatus = 'DISCARDED'
end

BE -> DB : Recalculate MENU_ITEM.IsAvailable\nfor all items with affected ingredients
DB --> BE : Updated availability results
BE --> UI : Notify: "Menu availability updated"

== Phase B: Customer Views Allergy-Filtered Personalized Daily Menu (UC17) ==

note over Customer, HealthDB
  **UC17: Select Personalized Daily Meals**
  BR-FNB-01: MENU_ITEM.AllergenTags ∩ GUEST_HEALTH_PROFILE.FoodAllergies → Exclude from customer menu
  BR-FNB-03 (UC20): Only FoodAllergies & DietaryPreferences visible to F&B Staff
  MedicalConditions & PhysicalLimitations MASKED / HIDDEN
end note

Customer -> UI : Open "Daily Meal Selection" screen
UI -> BE : GET: Load Menu for today (MEAL_TYPE, DATE)
BE -> HealthDB : Fetch FoodAllergies & DietaryPreferences\n🔒 MASKED: MedicalConditions, PhysicalLimitations
HealthDB --> BE : Return {FoodAllergies, DietaryPreferences}
BE -> DB : SELECT MENU_ITEM WHERE IsAvailable = TRUE
DB --> BE : Return available MENU_ITEM records
BE -> BE : Cross-check AllergenTags vs FoodAllergies\n→ Exclude every conflicting item
BE --> UI : Return only available, profile-compatible items\n(Dietary type filter applied: VEGAN, KETO, HALAL...)

Customer -> UI : Select meals for Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner
Customer -> UI : Optionally add SpecialNotes
Customer -> UI : Confirm daily meal selection

UI -> BE : POST: Submit meal selection
BE -> DB : INSERT MEAL_ORDER\n(RoomBookingID, AccountID, OrderDate, MealType, IsALaCarte=FALSE)
BE -> DB : INSERT MEAL_ORDER_LINE\n(MenuItemID, Quantity, UnitPrice=0)
DB --> BE : OK - Meal order created
BE --> UI : Show confirmation: "Your meals are pre-selected"
UI --> Customer : Display "My Meal Plan" with selected items

== Phase C: Customer Orders Extra A-la-carte Items (UC18) ==

note over Customer, Folio
  **UC18: Order Extra A-la-carte Items**
  BR-FNB-04 / BR-08: IsALaCarte=TRUE → Auto-post FOLIO_CHARGE_ITEM (ChargeType='EXTRA_FB')
end note

Customer -> UI : Open "Extra A-la-carte Order" screen
UI -> BE : GET: Load a-la-carte menu (all available extras with prices)
BE -> DB : SELECT MENU_ITEM WHERE Price > 0 AND IsAvailable = TRUE
DB --> BE : Return available a-la-carte items
BE -> BE : Exclude items matching declared FoodAllergies
BE --> UI : Display safe a-la-carte catalog with prices

Customer -> UI : Select extra items & quantities
UI -> BE : Subtotal preview = SUM(Quantity × UnitPrice)
BE --> UI : Confirm preview amount in VND

Customer -> UI : Confirm order\n(Agree to post charge to Folio)
UI -> BE : POST: Submit a-la-carte order
BE -> DB : INSERT MEAL_ORDER\n(IsALaCarte=TRUE, TotalAmount=SUM)
BE -> DB : INSERT MEAL_ORDER_LINE\n(Quantity, UnitPrice)

BE -> Folio : POST: Create FOLIO_CHARGE_ITEM\n(ChargeType='EXTRA_FB', Amount=TotalAmount,\nPaymentStatus='PENDING', MealOrderID)
Folio --> BE : ChargeItemID confirmed
DB --> BE : MEAL_ORDER created
BE --> UI : "A-la-carte order placed & charge posted to your folio"
UI --> Customer : Show order confirmation with folio reference

== Phase D: Chef / F&B Staff Fulfills Meal Orders (UC19 / UC20) ==

note over Chef, DB
  **UC19: Fulfill Meal Orders**
  **UC20: Enforce F&B Health-Data Minimization (RBAC)**
  BR-FNB-02: Chef sees only the minimal FoodAllergies and DietaryPreferences projection.
  All MedicalConditions, PhysicalLimitations → STRICTLY HIDDEN.
end note

Chef -> UI : Open "Daily Meal Prep Dashboard" (Kitchen KDS View)
UI -> BE : GET: Load active MEAL_ORDER list for today
BE -> DB : SELECT MEAL_ORDER JOIN MEAL_ORDER_LINE\nWHERE OrderDate = TODAY AND OrderStatus = 'PENDING'
DB --> BE : Return active meal orders with order lines

note over BE
  **RBAC Enforcement (BR-FNB-02 / UC20):**
  Output includes ONLY:
  ✅ FoodAllergies (food allergy flags)
  ✅ DietaryPreferences (VEGAN, HALAL, etc.)
  🔒 BLOCKED: MedicalConditions
  🔒 BLOCKED: PhysicalLimitations
end note

BE --> UI : Display orders with:\n• Villa No. / Room No.\n• Meal items & quantities\n• ⚠ ALLERGY WARNING (if any)\n• No medical/payment data exposed

Chef -> UI : Mark order line as PREPARING
UI -> BE : PATCH: OrderLineID → PreparationStatus = 'PREPARING'
BE -> DB : UPDATE MEAL_ORDER_LINE SET PreparationStatus = 'PREPARING'

Chef -> UI : Mark order line as READY (meal prepared)
UI -> BE : PATCH: OrderLineID → PreparationStatus = 'READY'
BE -> DB : UPDATE MEAL_ORDER_LINE SET PreparationStatus = 'READY'

BE -> DB : INSERT INGREDIENT_USAGE_LOG\n(OrderLineID, BatchID, QuantityUsed, LoggedByStaffID, DeductedAt)
BE -> DB : UPDATE INGREDIENT_BATCH\nSET RemainingQuantity = RemainingQuantity - QuantityUsed
DB --> BE : Ingredient batch deducted successfully

Chef -> UI : Mark MEAL_ORDER as DELIVERED
UI -> BE : PATCH: MealOrderID → OrderStatus = 'DELIVERED'
BE -> DB : UPDATE MEAL_ORDER SET OrderStatus = 'DELIVERED', UpdatedAt = NOW()
DB --> BE : Status updated
BE --> UI : Order marked DELIVERED

note over DB, Folio
  **System Auto-trigger (BR-FNB-04):**
  A-la-carte orders with IsALaCarte=TRUE already have their
  FOLIO_CHARGE_ITEM (ChargeType='EXTRA_FB') posted to
  Module 5 Guest Folio at order submission time (Phase C).
  This charge is locked in until Checkout (Module 5 - BR-09).
end note

@enduml
